  "details": "Since the 2023/4/20 vrchat update, the instance initialization timeout is very short (probably 60-120 seconds)\n\nSome large worlds will time out and force redirection to the error world.\n\nThe following message was recorded in the output log:\n\nError      -  [API] [362, 403, Get, -1] Abandoning request, because - Travel to instance has taken too long․\n\nFeature Request:\n\nAdd an optional timeout option that users can arbitrarily specify.",
